OL,3,GNEWSAKeep dancing: 100-year-old leads
OL,4,Acharity flash mob
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 100-year-old man, already known for
OL,7,Fhis dance moves through social media,
OL,8,Fled a flash mob with hundreds of people
OL,9,Fjoining in.
OL,11,FWearing a bright red shirt, Bernard
OL,12,FGilbert directed a dance to song King
OL,13,Fof the Road by country singer Roger
OL,14,FMiller in Worcester city centre, with
OL,15,Fcrowds erupting in applause after he
OL,16,Ffinished.
OL,18,FThe former dance teacher previously
OL,19,Fwent viral on social media for his
OL,20,Fmoves at Fernhill House Care Home where
OL,21,Fhe lives. His videos were seen more
OL,22,Fthan 1.5m times.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
