OL,3,GNEWSAKeep dancing: 100-year-old leads
OL,4,Acharity flash mob
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I love the dancing, once I get on the
OL,7,Ffloor I forget everything, I just
OL,8,Fconcentrate on what I'm doing," he said
OL,9,Fwhen the BBC interviewed him in June.
